Branching:
basically it is looping. 
GOTO 

if R0>0:
    R1=1
else:
    R1=0

@R0
D=M

@8
D;JGT

@R1
M=0
@10
0;JMP

@R1
M=1

@10
0;JMP

However the above code is cryptic.
better way:

@R0
D=M

@POSITIVE
D;JGT

@R1
M=0
@END
0; JMP

(POSITIVE)
@R1
M=1

(END)
@END
0;JMP


